                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1ea81a5e-0b35-3692-b24d-e34161d42f60",
                        "entry_id": "69187f9d-3b76-325a-8995-821d96865a4a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "weibliche Person, die sich mit Deutungen astronomischer Ereignisse und Gestirnskonstellationen in Bezug auf irdische Verhältnisse und Vorgänge beschäftigt"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Beruf"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8dd9f388-eff7-4e86-bbb7-66285b715cc7",
                                "sense_id": "1ea81a5e-0b35-3692-b24d-e34161d42f60",
                                "text": "„Meine Stimme ist nicht nur meine Stimme, sie ist auch mein Körper, mein Wesen und meine Gedanken. Da ich meinen Körper für die Arbeit brauche, mache ich täglich Gymnastik und Yoga und lasse von einer Astrologin meinen Biorhythmus bestimmen. Außerdem muss ich möglichst acht Stunden pro Nacht schlafen, wobei zu wenig Schlaf nach einer anstrengenden Vorstellung wesentlich kritischer ist als zu wenig Schlaf davor.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "057a3b2a-fa57-424f-9dae-5a9167d089a4",
                                "sense_id": "1ea81a5e-0b35-3692-b24d-e34161d42f60",
                                "text": "„Ein \"apokalyptisches Jahr\" habe die Astrologin Christiane Durer angekündigt mit Naturkatastrophen, einer neuen Krankheit und einer Pandemie.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "55087acb-9b03-406e-9680-940ca6eb7a8a",
                        "source_entry_id": "69187f9d-3b76-325a-8995-821d96865a4a",
                        "source_sense_id": "1ea81a5e-0b35-3692-b24d-e34161d42f60",
                        "source_sense_description": "weibliche Person, die sich mit Astrologie beschäftigt",
                        "target_lang_word": "astrologer",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "astrologer",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d5cb7274-a0e5-38c7-befb-05e731ba7261",
                                        "entry_id": "4d8219d8-847d-3c1a-89eb-ea28a34c092e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who studies or practices astrology."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "acecf860-b5c7-4572-88af-1733bf747ee7",
                                                "sense_id": "d5cb7274-a0e5-38c7-befb-05e731ba7261",
                                                "text": "Nicolaus Copernicus and Johannes Kepler both made a living as astrologers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bc99d59e-690e-405b-bf8e-7e972e4b6bc1",
                                                "sense_id": "d5cb7274-a0e5-38c7-befb-05e731ba7261",
                                                "text": "When witchcraft became a statutory offence again in 1563, astrologers reincurred the risk of prosecution […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "db30f01d-432d-4bcf-8b43-d226d3dc6637",
                                                "sense_id": "d5cb7274-a0e5-38c7-befb-05e731ba7261",
                                                "text": "Astrologers, when they observe this pattern, insist that it corresponds to the zodiacal progression. I am not an astrologer and I hold no brief for it, but I do believe the origins of astrology are not with the Chaldeans of Mesopotamia but with the hunters and gatherers of the Stone Age."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2ce212e5-c6bf-44ea-8c03-98f79c849a77",
                        "source_entry_id": "69187f9d-3b76-325a-8995-821d96865a4a",
                        "source_sense_id": "1ea81a5e-0b35-3692-b24d-e34161d42f60",
                        "source_sense_description": "weibliche Person, die sich mit Astrologie beschäftigt",
                        "target_lang_word": "astrologist",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "astrologist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8f245e81-3b75-37ef-88fe-e8e2b56887b7",
                                        "entry_id": "e1897ca4-fb18-3062-8c32-85eee6018281",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who practices astrology; an astrologer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d0c11d67-5ef6-4092-bbb6-f00508ab3bdf",
                                                "sense_id": "8f245e81-3b75-37ef-88fe-e8e2b56887b7",
                                                "text": "So the king sent his painters to Moses and they brought back a picture of him. The king called his phrenologists and astrologists and asked them, \"What kind of man is this?\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "50bb85ac-2000-4b49-8162-133e36e1623f",
                                                "sense_id": "8f245e81-3b75-37ef-88fe-e8e2b56887b7",
                                                "text": "According to Accurso, there is evidence that advice from astrologists had no effect on Hitler's actions."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8321d229-34e5-49a5-b51a-0c35d28e53fc",
                                                "sense_id": "8f245e81-3b75-37ef-88fe-e8e2b56887b7",
                                                "text": "2003, Dr. Abu Ameenah Bilal Philips, The Islamic Ruling on Horoscopes, in The Friday Bulletin: The Muslim News Update, Issue 29, Part 184, Muslim Media Network, Kenya, page number not shown,\nNot only is the practice of astrology Haram, but also visiting an astrologist and listening to his predictions, buying books on astrology or reading one's horoscope are also forbidden!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "14ea620c-ee47-4e9c-ba4a-17213e117672",
                        "source_entry_id": "69187f9d-3b76-325a-8995-821d96865a4a",
